/* Master skill icon atlases as sprites, shared by every document that draws a master skill icon.
   GENERATED -- one sprite per 20x28 cell of the two 512x512 atlases, 25 cells per row, named
   master-icon-lit-<n> / master-icon-grey-<n> after SKILL_ATTRIBUTE::Magic_Icon (n % 25 across,
   n / 25 down); UI::Skills::MasterTree::IconSpriteName() builds the names. Lit is
   new_Master_Icon.jpg, grey new_Master_non_Icon.jpg. Identical in every theme: the icons are
   content, not chrome. */

@spritesheet master-icon-lit-sheet
